1	//! The release provider port.
2	//!
3	//! Every remote fact and every remote effect in the release path goes through
4	//! one of these providers. The executor talks only to [`ReleaseProviderSet`],
5	//! so an in-memory set can drive it without a real registry, remote, or forge;
6	//! [`super::ValidatedReleaseIntent`] supplies the production implementation.
7	
8	use std::path::{Path, PathBuf};
9	
